# NOTORA — MVP FEATURE SCOPE
**Product:** AI-powered Notes & Productivity App  
**Tagline:** Capture. Organise. Create.  
**Design:** Sand & Terracotta

## 1. Home Dashboard
- Recent notes.
- Pinned notes.
- Search bar.
- Quick-create note button.
- Folder shortcuts.
- Upcoming reminders preview.
- Recently modified notes.
- Grid and list view options.

## 2. Notes Management
- Create, edit and delete notes.
- Autosave.
- Rich-text formatting (bold, italic, headings, bullet points).
- Checklists and to-do lists.
- Add images to notes.
- Pin and favourite notes.
- Archive notes.
- Note creation and modification timestamps.

## 3. Organisation
- Create and manage folders.
- Basic tags and labels.
- Move notes between folders.
- Filter notes by folder and tag.
- Recently deleted notes.
- Favourites.

## 4. AI Assistant
- Summarise notes.
- Rewrite and improve text.
- Grammar and spelling correction.
- Expand short notes.
- Convert paragraphs into bullet points.
- Convert notes into checklists.
- Extract tasks and action items.
- Ask questions about a selected note.
- Generate content from prompts.

## 5. Smart Capture
- Quick note creation.
- Voice-to-text note capture.
- Natural-language date and time recognition.
- Detect tasks and deadlines in notes.
- Suggest reminders from note content.
- Convert unstructured thoughts into organised checklists.

## 6. Reminders and Notifications
- Create reminders manually.
- Create reminders directly from notes.
- AI-suggested reminders.
- Custom date and time.
- One-time and recurring reminders.
- Local phone notifications.
- Snooze and dismiss.
- Mark reminders as completed.
- Upcoming and overdue reminders.
- Notification permission management.

## 7. Basic Tasks Management
- Dedicated tasks screen.
- Create tasks manually.
- Convert notes into tasks.
- Task due dates.
- Task priorities.
- Mark tasks as complete.
- Today's tasks.
- Upcoming tasks.
- Overdue tasks.

## 8. Phone Integration
- Native notification integration.
- Background reminder scheduling.
- Home screen quick-capture widget where supported.
- Share content from other apps into Notora.
- Calendar access for reading events, with permission.
- Native alarm creation through supported OS integrations, subject to permissions and platform support.

## 9. Search
- Instant keyword search.
- Search across note titles and contents.
- Filter by folder and tag.
- Search tasks and reminders.
- Basic AI-powered semantic search if feasible within the initial AI architecture.

## 10. Settings and Personalisation
- Light mode.
- Dark mode.
- Automatic system theme.
- Sand & Terracotta default theme.
- Basic font-size controls.
- App lock using biometrics where supported.
- Notification preferences.
- Account settings.

## 11. Data and Synchronisation
- User authentication.
- Cloud storage.
- Automatic cloud sync.
- Offline note creation and editing.
- Sync when internet connectivity returns.
- Basic backup and recovery.
- Data export.

## 12. Core Design Requirements
- Premium iOS-inspired interface.
- Fluid navigation and transitions.
- Smooth animations and micro-interactions.
- Minimalist layout.
- Rounded cards and buttons.
- Consistent Sand & Terracotta colour system.
- Feather-and-sparkle Notora logo.
- Responsive design.
- Fast loading and autosaving.
- Accessible typography and controls.

---

## MVP SUCCESS CRITERIA

A user should be able to:

1. Open Notora and immediately create a note.
2. Organise that note into a folder.
3. Ask AI to summarise or rewrite it.
4. Have AI identify an actionable task.
5. Create a reminder from that task.
6. Receive a notification at the scheduled time.
7. Find the note again using search.

**This is the core Notora experience.**